 "note": "New-money issues only; refundings are left out. Present value at issue of 30 years of lost federal income tax at a 28 percent marginal rate.",
 "method": "select f.team, f.arena, cast(f.year as integer) as year, f.issuer_series, f.par_m, f.tax_status, f.pv3_30yr_fed_loss_m as pv_m, f.pv3_30yr_fed_loss_m * coalesce((select factor_2026 from cpi where cpi.year = f.year), 1) as pv_2026_m from fed_bond_cost f where f.tau = 0.28 and f.tax_status <> 'planned' and exists (select 1 from arena_bonds b where b.team = f.team and cast(b.year as integer) = f.year and b.issuer_series = f.issuer_series and b.new_money = 'True') order by f.year, f.team, f.issuer_series"
}
